---
title: Saturday-Night Special
author: Mildred McKinzie
category: Casseroles
cook time: 45 minutes
source: Loving Memories of Mildred
---

@hamburger{1%lb}
@baked bean{1%large can}
@bacon{4%slices}
@finely chopped onion{1}
@chopped tomatoes{1%can}
@brown sugar{0.25%cup}
@salt
@pepper

Brown hamburger and onion. Salt and pepper. In a casserole dish, mix the hamburger, baked beans and tomatoes. Add the brown sugar and mix. Lay the bacon slices on top of the casserole. Bake at 350 degrees for 45 minutes.
